{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03025","headline":"南郊太尉酌献武舞作凯安之乐 · 张九龄","name":"南郊太尉酌献武舞作凯安之乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"馨香惟后德，明命光天保。\n肃祀崇圣灵，陈信表黄道。\n玉戚初蹈厉，金匏既静好。\n介福何穰穰，精诚格穹昊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03025.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03025","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}